[1.810, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;114m┃ Assistant\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[38;5;114m┃\u001b[0m Honestly, not much. I have the memory and when I wrote it, but nobody\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[38;5;114m┃\u001b[0m recorded who said it, whether it was stated or worked out, or what it\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[38;5;114m┃\u001b[0m came from. The licence is the default — nobody chose it.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[38;5;114m┃\u001b[0m \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[38;5;114m┃\u001b[0m Those are absences, not blanks. I did not lose them; they were never\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[38;5;114m┃\u001b[0m recorded. If this matters, tell me and I will record it properly.\r\n"]
